      "widgets_values": [
        "An authentic industrial documentary close-up of the smooth blank silicon wafer shown in the reference photograph. The camera makes a very slow shallow arc around the rigid wafer and moves slightly closer, revealing its thin circular edge and smooth polished face. A broad white studio reflection moves naturally across the silver surface as the viewpoint changes. The solid silicon disk retains exactly the same circular shape and material. Clean neutral silver highlights, realistic surface reflections, restrained black and gray surroundings, detailed premium macro cinematography. The subject is stationary. One stable continuous shot, no transitions. No chip patterns, writing, symbols or graphics."
      ]
